Sample Survey for Writing Instructors
.sp 3
.ft R
.ps 12
.BL 3
.LI
What kinds of preparation or prewriting do you perform before
writing?
.sp 1in
.LI
Do you do different prewriting exercises for different texts?
.sp 1in
.LI
What kinds of prewriting do you encourage your students to do before
they write?  
.sp 1in
.LI
Do you encourage the use of any prewriting models?
.sp 1in
.LI
Were you taught prewriting methods as a student? If so - what methods
were taught?
.sp 1in
.LI
As a writer who teaches writing, do you teach the same methods of
prewriting that you practice?  Why or why not?
